Subject: [PATCH] Deterministic frame-by-frame renderer with 3D, math and
 cartoon styles

- runtime.js: virtual clock (time, timers, rAF, CSS/Web animations) so every frame is exact
- render.py: loopback HTTP server, /vendor libs + import map, PNG frames piped to ffmpeg
- three, gsap, d3, katex bundled in the sandbox image; mathkit (manim-style) toolkit
- agent prompt: choose 3D / math / cartoon / design-kit style from the request
- examples (math-3b1b, three-3d, cartoon-explainer), CLI `example` command
- tests rewritten for the new renderer; SANDBOX_TIMEOUT_SECONDS default 3600

